                <msContents>
                    <summary/>
                    <msItem xml:id="ms_i1">
                        <locus from="2ra" to="58va"/>
                        <title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/NAR0004comput">Computation of the cycles of years according to several calendars</title>
                        <textLang xml:lang="gez"/>
                        <incipit xml:lang="gez"><locus target="#4ra"/> ሐሳበ፡ ክንትሮስ፡ ክንትሮስሰ፡ ፩ዘከፈልዎ፡ ለ፩ሰዓት፡ ኀበ፡ ፴ውእቱ፡ ወለ፩ዕለት፡ ኀበ፡ ፫፻ወ፷ክፍል፤ 
                            አመ፡ ፴ሁ፡ ለመስከረም፡ ይትዔረይ፡ መዓልት፡ ምስለ፡ ሌሊት፡</incipit>
                    </msItem>
                    <msItem xml:id="ms_i2">
                        <locus from="58ra" to="58vb"/>
                        <title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT3855KingList">List of kings of Ethiopia</title>
                        <textLang xml:lang="gez"/>
                        <incipit xml:lang="gez">ዓመታተ፡ ነገሥታተ፡ አክሱም፡ እለ፡ ነግሡ፡ በኢትዮጵያ፡ ዘአርዌ፡ ዓመት፡ ፬፻ዘብእሴ፡ እንጋቦ፡ ዘሰደዶ፡ ለአርዌ፡ ዓመት፡ ፪፻። ዘግዱር፡ 
                            ዘበኑሕ፡ ዓመት፨ ፩፻</incipit>
                    </msItem>
                    <msItem xml:id="ms_i3">
                        <locus target="#58vb"/>
                        <title type="incomplete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT3853KingList">Chronological note on the Aksumite kings of Ethiopia</title>
                        <textLang xml:lang="gez"/>
                        <incipit xml:lang="gez"> ዓመታተ፡ ነገሥተ፡ አክሱም፡ እምአርዌ፡ እስከ፡ ናልኬ፡ ነገሥቱ፡ ፲፩ዓመታቲሆሙ፡ ፱፻፸፪ወእምድኅረ፡ ናልኬ፡ ነግሠ፡ ብእሴ፡ ባዜን፡
                            ዓመት፡ ፲፯።</incipit>
                    </msItem>
                    <msItem xml:id="ms_i4">
                        <locus from="59ra" to="59vb"/>
                        <title type="incomplete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT6936TarWaAmidBeta#preislamichistory">Excerpt on the kings of Israel from the Tārika Walda ʾAmid</title>
                        <textLang xml:lang="gez"/>
                        <incipit xml:lang="gez">በስመ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ መሐሪ፡ ወመስተሣህል፡ ንዌጥን፡ ጽሒፈ፡ መጽሐፈ፡ ዘይነግር፡ ኍልቈ፡ ዓመታተ፡ ዓለም፡ ዘአስተጋብአ፡ አብ፡ ክቡር፡ 
                            ወትሩፍ፡ ጊዮርጊስ፡ ወልደ፡ አሚድ፡ ዘብሔረ፡ ግብጽ፡ ጸሎቱ፡ የሀሉ፡ ምስሌነ፡ አሜን።</incipit>
                    </msItem>
                    <msItem xml:id="ms_i5">
                        <locus from="59vb" to="61vb"/>
                        <title>Compendium of biblical and Christian history until the Solomonic kings.</title>
                        <textLang xml:lang="gez"/>
                        <note>Possibly partly taken from the <ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT6936TarWaAmidBeta">Tārika Walda ʾAmid (β-recension)</ref>.</note>
                        <incipit xml:lang="gez">ወእምድኅረ፡ ኮነ፡ ክፍል፡ ዘ፲ነገድ፡ ኢዮርብዓም፡ ወልደ፡ ናባጥ፡ ነግሠ፡ ፳ወ፬ዓመተ፤ ናባጥ፡ ወልዱ፡ ነግሠ፡ ፪ዓመተ፤ በአስ፡ ወልደ፡ አኪያ፡
                            ነግሠ፡ ፳ወ፬ዓመተ።</incipit>
                    </msItem>
                    <msItem xml:id="ms_i6">
                        <locus target="#61vb"/>
                        <title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT3852KingList">Short chronological note on the Aksumite kings.</title>
                        <textLang xml:lang="gez"/>
                        <quote xml:lang="gez">እምልደተ፡ እግዚእነ፡ እስከ፡ አጽብሐ፡ ወአብርሃ፡ ፪፻፴ወ፭እምአብርሃ፡ ወአጽብሐ፡ እስከ፡ ገብረ፡ መስቀል፡ ወልደ፡ ካሌብ፡ ፻፸ወ፬። እምገብረ፡ 
                            መስቀል፡ እስከ፡ መንግሥተ፡ ዛጔ፡ ፪፻፵ወ፬።</quote>
                    </msItem>
                    <msItem xml:id="ms_i7">
                        <locus from="62rb" to="63vb"/>
                        <title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/NAR0004comput">Chronological notes and computations</title>
                        <note>Accompanied by a table with three columns for each month on <locus target="#63r"/>.</note>
                        <textLang xml:lang="gez"/>
                        <incipit xml:lang="gez">ንጽሕፍ፡ ፍልጠተ፡ ዕለታት፡ ዘይነቅዝ፡ ወዘኢይነቅዝ፡ ቦሙ፡ ዘፈለጡ፡ ወዘከፈልዎሙ፡ ጠቢባን፡ እምአውራኂሆሙ፡ ለዓመት፡ እንዘ፡ 
                            ይገዝሙ፡ <pb/> ቦሙ፡ ዕፀ፡ ወየዓፅዱ፡ እክለ።</incipit>
                    </msItem>
                    <msItem xml:id="ms_i8">
                        <locus from="65ra"/>
                        <title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT1913Mashaf">Maṣḥafa ʾAksum</title>
                        <note>The order of the parts is the same as in <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLbruce93#p2_i2">Oxford, Bodleian Library, Bodleian Bruce 93: Maṣḥafa ʾAksum (in p2_i2)</ref>.</note>
                        <textLang xml:lang="gez"/>
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i8.1">
                            <locus target="#65ra"/>
                            <title type="incomplete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT4682Kamaze">Kama-zǝ nubāre śǝrʿātā la-ʾǝmmǝna Ṣǝyon gabaza ʾAksum</title>
                            <incipit xml:lang="gez">ከመዝ፡ ኑባሬ፡ ሥርዓታ፡ ለእምነ፡ ጽዮን፡ ገበዘ፡ አክሱም፡ እስከ፡ ፲ወ፭በእመት፡ ኢረከቡ፡ መሠረታ፡ ወጸፍጸፉ፡ ከዲሕ፡ ፯በእመት፡ እምድር፡ 
                                እስከ፡ አፈ፡ ጽዮን፡ ወከርሠ፡ ንድቁ፡ ፯በእመት።</incipit>    
                        </msItem>
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i8.2">
                            <locus from="65ra" to="66vb"/>
                            <title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT2348serata">Śǝrʿāta qʷǝrḥat</title>
                            <incipit xml:lang="gez">ዝውእቱ፡ መጽሐፈ፡ ዘወሀቦ፡ ሰሎሞ<cb/>ን፡ ንጉሥ፡ ለአብነ፡ ሐኪም፡ ወልዱ፡ ወወሀቦ፡ ሰብአ፡ ሕግ፡ እለ፡ የሐውሩ፡ ምስሌሁ፡ ሀገረ፡ ኢትዮጵያ። 
                                ዝውእቱ፡ አስማቲሆሙ።</incipit>
                        </msItem>
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i8.3">
                            <locus from="66vb" to="68va"/>
                            <title type="incomplete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT4683Amatata">ʿĀmatāta nagaśtāta ʾAksum</title>
                            <incipit xml:lang="gez">ዓመታተ፡ ነገሥታተ፡ አክሱም። ዘአርዌ፡ ፬፻ዓመት። ዘብእሴ፡ እንጋቦ፡ ዘሰደዶ፡ ለአርዌ፡ ወቀተሎ፡ ፪፻ዓመት። በግዱር፡ ዘበኑሕ፡ ፻ዓመት፤ ዘሰበጾ፡ በሳዩ፡ 
                                ፶ዓመት።</incipit>
                            <msItem xml:id="ms_i8.3.1">
                                <locus from="67va" to="68rb"/>
                                <title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT3855KingList">Additional notes on the Aksumite kings</title>
                                <textLang xml:lang="gez"/>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">ወዝ፡ ውእቱ፡ ዓመታተ፡ ነገሥተ፡ አክሱም፡ እምአርዌ፡ እስከ፡ ናልኴ፡ ፲ወ፩ ነገሥት፡ ወዓመታቲሆሙ፡ ፱፻ወ፸ወ፪። ወእምድኅረ፡ ናልኴ፡ ብእሴ፡ ባዜን፡ 
                                    ፲ወ፯ዓመት፤</incipit>
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="ms_i8.3.2">
                                <locus from="68rb" to="68va"/>
                                <title type="incomplete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT3853KingList">List of the kings of Jerusalem and of Ethiopia</title>
                                <note>Copied by <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS3182ContiRo">
                  Carlo
                  Conti Rossini
               </persName> in <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/ANLcr125#_i1">Rome, Biblioteca dell’Accademia Nazionale dei Lincei, Conti Rossini 125:  _i1</ref>.</note>
                                <textLang xml:lang="gez"/>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">እለ፡ ነግሡ፡ እስራኤል፡ በኢትዮጵያ፡ ዝውእቱ፡ አስማቲሆሙ፡ ፩እብነ፡ እልሐኪም፤ ፪ቶማይ፤ ፫አዝባይ፤ ፬አክሱማይ፤ ፭ተክላይ፤ ፮ሕንቁቃይ።</incipit>
                            </msItem>
                        </msItem>
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i8.4">
                            <locus from="68va"/>
                            <title type="incomplete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT4681Restauration">Restauration of the royal throne in ʾAksum</title>
                        </msItem>
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i8.5">
                            <locus from="68vb" to="69va"/>
                            <title type="incomplete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT4683Amatata">ʿĀmatāta nagaśtāta ʾAksum</title>
                            <msItem xml:id="ms_i8.5.1">
                                <locus from="68vb" to="69va"/>
                                <title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT3861KingList">Genealogy from Adam to king Yāʿqob</title>
                                <note>Short genealogy of biblical and Aksumite kings ending in <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS10198Yaeqob">Yāʿqob</persName>.</note>
                                <textLang xml:lang="gez"/>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">ልደተ፡ አበው፡ አዳም፡ ወለዶ፡ ለሴት፡ ወሴት፡ ለሄኖስ፡ ወሄኖስ፡ ለቀይናን፡ ወቀይናን፡ ወለዶ፡ ለመላሌል። ወመሳኤል፡ ወለዶ፡ ለያሬድ። 
                                    ወያሬድ፡ ለሄኖክ፤ ወሄኖክ፡ ወለዶ፡ ለማቱሳላ።</incipit>
                                <explicit xml:lang="gez">እምልደተ፡ እግዚእነ፡ ክርስቶስ፡ እመንግሥተ፡ ባዜን፡ እስከ፡ አብርሃ፡ ወአጽብሐ፡ ፪፻ወ፴ወ፯። <gap reason="ellipsis" unit="lines" quantity="13"/>
                                    ወእሚናስ፡ እስከ፡ ሠርፀ፡ ድንግል፡ ፴ወ፬ ዓመት። ወእምሠርፀ፡ ድንግል፡ እስከ፡ ያዕቆብ። <gap reason="omitted" unit="chars" quantity="9"/>
                                    ወጳጳሳትሂ፡ እለ፡ ወፅኡ፡ ኢትዮጵያ፡ እምአባ፡ ሰላማ፡ ከሣቴ፡ ብርሃን፡ እስከ፡ አባ፡ ጴጥሮስ፡ ኍልቆሙ፡ ፺ወ፩ ጳጳሳት።</explicit>
                            </msItem>    
                        </msItem>
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i8.6">
                            <locus from="69va" to="74ra"/>
                            <title type="incomplete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT4681Restauration">Restauration of the royal throne in ʾAksum</title>
                            <textLang xml:lang="gez"/>
                            <incipit xml:lang="gez">በአኰቴተ፡ አብ፡ ወወልድ፡ ወመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ንሕነ፡ እለ፡ አብርሃ፡ ወአጽብሐ፡ ነገሥተ፡ አክሱም፡ ጐለትነ፡ ጕልተ፡ ለገበዘ፡ አክሱም፡ ሐውስታ፡</incipit>
                        </msItem>
                    </msItem>
                    <msItem xml:id="ms_i9">
                        <locus from="74ra" to="74rb"/>
                        <title>Interpretation of a passage from the Maṣḥafa Qalemǝnṭos</title>
                        <note>Interpretation of a passage from 
                            <ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT1957Mashaf#Book3">Qalemǝnṭos, Book 3, chapter 9, verse 20)</ref>.</note>
                        <textLang xml:lang="gez"/>
                        <incipit xml:lang="gez">እመጽሐፈ፡ ቀሌምንጦስ፡ ገይን፡ ዘይቤ፡ ጋብዮስ፤ ቃፍ፡ ዘይቤ፡ ቅላውዴዎስ፤ ኖን፡ ዘ፡ አሮን፤ አልድ፡ ዘ፡ አስባስያኖስ፤ ጣ፡ ዘ፡ ጢጦስ፤ ዳል፤
                            ዘ፤ ድምጥያኖስ፤</incipit>
                    </msItem>
                    <msItem xml:id="ms_i10">
                        <locus from="74rb" to="74vb"/>
                        <title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT4690Chronology">List of Muslim caliphs</title>
                        <textLang xml:lang="gez"/>
                        <incipit xml:lang="gez">ጥያቄ፡ ጥንተ፡ ዕለተ፡ ዘመኖሙ፡ ለተንበላት፡ በዕለተ፡ ሐሙስ፡ አመ፡ ፳ወ፩ለወርኃ፡ ሐምሌ። በ፷፻ወ፩፻ወ፲ወ፬እምዓመተ፡ ዓለም።
                            ፩መሐመድ፤ ፲ወ፬ዓመት። ፪አቡበከር፡ ፪ዓመት፤</incipit>
                    </msItem>
                    <msItem xml:id="ms_i11">
                        <locus from="74vb" to="76vb"/>
                        <title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT4694Zena">List of the patriarchs of Alexandria</title>
                        <textLang xml:lang="gez"/>
                        <incipit xml:lang="gez">ዝውእቱ፡ ዜና፡ ስሞሙ፡ ለአበዊነ፡ ሊቃነ፡ ጳጳሳት፡ ዘእለ፡ እስክንድርያ፡ ቀ<pb/>ዳሚ፡ ማርቆስ፡ ወንጌላዊ፡ ነበረ፡ በመንበረ፡ ጵጵስና፡ ፯ዓመተ፡ 
                            ወ፲ወ፩ወርኃ።</incipit>
                    </msItem>
                    <msItem xml:id="ms_i12">
                        <locus target="76vb"/>
                        <title>Prayer</title>
                        <note>Possibly a fragment containing an allusion to <ref cRef="betMas:LIT2709Matthew.25.41">Mt 25:41</ref>.</note>
                        <textLang xml:lang="gez"/>
                        <quote xml:lang="gez">ዘነበቦ፡ ለሙሴ፡ ፭፻ወ፹ወ፪ግርማ፡ ምጽአቱ፡ ለእግዚእ፡ ክርስቶስ፡ ፯ሺሕ፡ ነጐድጓደ፡ ክረምት፡ ኢይከውን፡ ቃለ፡ ዘአሜሃ፡ እንዘ፡ ይብል፡ ሑሩ፡ 
                            እምኔየ፡ ርጉማን፡ ውስተ፡ እሳት።</quote>
                    </msItem>
                    <msItem xml:id="ms_i13">
                        <locus from="76vb" to="77ra"/>
                        <title type="incomplete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT1913Mashaf">Excerpt from the Maṣḥafa ʾAksum</title>
                        <note>Excerpt from the Maṣḥafa ʾAksum on deeds emanated by king <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS10626ZaraY">Zarʾa Yāʿqob</persName>.</note>
                        <textLang xml:lang="gez"/>
                        <incipit xml:lang="gez"> ዘሠርዓ፡ ሐፄ፡ ዘርአ፡ ያዕቆብ፡ ዣን፡ ጽጌ፡ ፯አድባራት፡ በበ፡ ፯መነኮሳት። ፩ደምባ፡ ተምቡኽ፤ ፪ጠሪጣ፤ ፬ማይ፡ በራዝየ፤ ፬ክብርቶ፤ ፭ፀዓዳ፡ 
                            አምባ፤ ፮ዘለ፡ አንበሳ። ፯ሰቃድርባ፤</incipit>
                    </msItem>
                    <msItem xml:id="ms_i14">
                        <locus from="77ra" to="78rb"/>
                        <title>Universal history from Moses to the Byzantine emperor Heraclius</title>
                        <note>Possibly taken from the <ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT6936TarWaAmidBeta#preislamichistory">Tārika Walda ʾAmid (β-recension): The
        pre-Islamic history from Adam to Heraclius.</ref>.</note>
                        <textLang xml:lang="gez"/>
                        <incipit xml:lang="gez">እሉ፡ መሳፍንት፡ ዘእስራኤል፡ ሙሴ፡ ነቢይ፡ ኰነኖሙ፡ ፵ዓመተ። ኢያሱ፡ ኰነኖሙ፡ ፵ዓመት። ጎቶንያል፡ ፶ዓ። ንጉሠ፡ ሞአብ፡ ፲ወ፰ዓ። 
                            ናዖድ፡ ፹፤ ሴሜገር፡ ዓ፤</incipit>
                    </msItem>
                    <msItem xml:id="ms_i15">
                        <locus from="78rb" to="79ra"/>
                        <title>Genealogy of the Virgin Mary and other notes</title>
                        <note>Taken from a book called ‘Maṣḥafa Sargis’, which is possibly the <ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT2290Sargis">Teaching of Jacob</ref>,
                            and the <ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT2375Synaxa">Synaxarion</ref>.</note>
                        <textLang xml:lang="gez"/>
                        <incipit xml:lang="gez">ከመዝ፡ ልደታ፡ ለእግዝእትነ፡ ማርያም፡ ዘተረክበ፡ እመጽሐፈ፡ ሰርጊስ፡ ወሰን<pb/>ክሳር። ቅስራ፡ ወማጣት፡ ወናታን፡ አኃው፡ እሙንቱ። 
                            ቅስራ፡ ወለዶ፡ ለኢያቄም፡ አበ፡ እግዝእትነ፡ ማርያም፤</incipit>
                    </msItem>
                    <msItem xml:id="ms_i16">
                        <locus from="79ra" to="80r"/>
                        <title>Book of the separation of the languages of the 81 books</title>
                        <note>Possibly taken from the <ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT2317Senodo">Senodos</ref>.</note>
                        <textLang xml:lang="gez"/>
                        <incipit xml:lang="gez">መጽሐፍ፡ ዘይፈልጥ፡ ልሳናቲሆሙ፡ ለ፹ወ፩መጻሕፍት፡ ቀዳሚ፡ አመ፡ ተከፍሉ፡ ፸ወ፪ልሳናት፡ በጽሐቶ፡ ለሴም፡ በብሔረ፡ ጽባሕ፡ 
                            እምኢየሩሳለኢም፡ እስከ፡ ምዕራብ።</incipit>
                    </msItem>
                    <msItem xml:id="ms_i17">
                        <locus from="80rb" to="80va"/>
                        <title type="incomplete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT5069Prayer">Saʾalnāka maḥari saʾalnāka faṭāri</title>
                        <note>A supplicative table prayer with some omissions and variations.</note>
                        <textLang xml:lang="gez"/>
                        <incipit xml:lang="gez">ሰአልናከ፡ መሐሪ፡ ሰአልናከ፡ ዘሰአልናከ፡ እንተ፡ ኢትከልእ፡ ወኢትፈልጥ፡ ወኢትሌሊ፡ የማንከ፡ ነቅዓ፡ ሕይወት፤ የማንከ፡ ነቅዓ፡ በረከት፤</incipit>
                    </msItem>
               </msContents>
